  "contract": {
    "factory": "Separate fixed no-argument build()/buildReturn() use one private boolean-selected builder; original publish proof does not depend on return probe/snapshot. Canonical runtime services, accessors, context, sink and linker unchanged.",
    "return": "Exact retained checked frames.returnScalar owner/signature/body. All operands live before ordinary INTERNAL call; old frame/windows/code/PC/loaded aliases invalidated on both outcomes. Only exact returnedSSA==1 true or returnedSSA~=1 false grants fresh parent epoch, followed by reacquire and CODE_START refresh.",
    "result": "Child tagged scalar selected before retirement. Boolean and explicit NIL produce exactly one value in parent slot2, State.lastResultCount1; adjacent slots preserved. RootControl remains active with count0, original value/serial/bytes unchanged. This is not completed root output or RetNil.",
    "lifetime": "Mapped entry-owned fixture storage and immutable borrowed checked CST/types are trusted. Whole-chain helper arena disjoint from logical frame pool and retained metadata. No callee dereference after retirement.",
    "arena": "Snapshot root-only cursor/top/issued before child prepare; after return cursor/top exactly restored while issued equals postchild value and rootIssued+1. RootControl/root identity/entryPC captured immediately after beginRoot before prepare.",
    "code": "Current Frame.code and retained original FunctionInfo.code equal saved entryPC before reading code or deriving expected resumePC/CODE_START. Resume is original entryPC+16."
  },
